gsipper (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Bundled GNOME-Shell status-bar extension at
    /usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/gsipper@pulpoff.com.
  * `gsipper --install-pjsua2` builds the PJSUA2 Python bindings
    from source into the user cache.

